{"id":"ced779f9ea9b74df","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-relative-completeness.md","title":"Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","display":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-relative-completeness","aliases":["89-df-relative-completeness"],"display":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions","depends_on":["[[89-df-effective-computation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-relative-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-relative-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-completeness — Relative Arithmetical Complexity and Reductions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X,A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k\">\\(\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 采用本书的 oracle 寄存器程序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X)\\)</span> 的元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^k\">\\(\\omega^k\\)</span> 上关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat A=\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}\">\\(\\widehat A=\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}\\)</span> 是自然数集合的一元关系表示。无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的层次取空 oracle，不使用相对可计算归约替代下述普通 many-one 归约。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>。关系的论元向量在显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^k\">\\(\\omega^k\\)</span> 域内量化。</li>\n<li>保留原省略元数的接口：在已声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span> 的关系上下文中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_n^0(X)\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_n^0(X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Pi_n^0(X)\">\\(R\\in\\Pi_n^0(X)\\)</span> 分别使用下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rec}^X\">\\(\\mathsf{Rec}^X\\)</span> 同理。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>、多一归约和数集复杂度类的上下文中，使用下式经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat A\">\\(\\widehat A\\)</span> 给出的数集版本。此为由论元类型确定的重载，不混合不同元数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}(X)&amp;=\\Pi^0_{0,k}(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\widehat A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\quad\n\\Pi^0_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Pi^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_n(\\varnothing),\\quad\\Pi^0_n\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_n(\\varnothing),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall t\\in\\omega\\ (t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B)\\\\\n(\\Sigma_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\Pi_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\mathsf{Rec}^X)_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}(X)&amp;=\\Pi^0_{0,k}(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\widehat A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\quad\n\\Pi^0_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Pi^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_n(\\varnothing),\\quad\\Pi^0_n\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_n(\\varnothing),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall t\\in\\omega\\ (t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B)\\\\\n(\\Sigma_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\Pi_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\mathsf{Rec}^X)_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 220–225；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这里分清“oracle 用于定义类”与“归约函数使用 oracle”：本条的多一归约函数为普通总可计算函数，后续相对真值定理沿用原书实际给出的这种有效编码归约。递归可枚举集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)\\)</span>；默认无 oracle 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span>。本条登记本书所需接口，不在此重造图灵机编码的基础理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat A=\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_n^0(X)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Pi_n^0(X)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rec}^X","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}(X)&=\\Pi^0_{0,k}(X)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k,\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}(X)&\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}(X)&\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\exists P\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}(X)\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ (\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\omega\\ (\\vec x\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in P))\\},\\\\\n\\widehat A&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n(X)&\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\quad\n\\Pi^0_n(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega\\mid\\widehat A\\in\\Pi^0_{n,1}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_n(\\varnothing),\\quad\\Pi^0_n\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_n(\\varnothing),\\\\\nA\\le_m B&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall t\\in\\omega\\ (t\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(t)\\in B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(B,\\mathcal C)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\ (A\\le_m B)\\\\\n(\\Sigma_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\Pi_n^0(X))_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_{n,k}(X),\\quad\n(\\mathsf{Rec}^X)_{\\omega^k}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rec}^X_k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n,\\Pi^0_n","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":3211,"backlinks":[{"id":"5